1
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,350
(Passenger Drop-off Area)

2
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:39,360
=Vow of Autumn=
=Episode 7=

3
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:19,600
Hmm, I'm not that old.

4
00:05:06,579 --> 00:05:07,439
Surprise!

5
00:05:08,959 --> 00:05:11,220
I know you've been swamped,

6
00:05:11,300 --> 00:05:12,939
so I brought you breakfast.

7
00:05:13,079 --> 00:05:15,160
Got your favorite coffee,

8
00:05:15,339 --> 00:05:16,300
plus fried dough sticks.

9
00:05:16,319 --> 00:05:17,180
As usual.

10
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:18,959
Oh, it's just you.

11
00:05:19,660 --> 00:05:21,060
Who else were you expecting?

12
00:05:21,060 --> 00:05:22,279
There's no man in your life.

13
00:05:25,279 --> 00:05:26,139
What's in your hand?

14
00:05:27,959 --> 00:05:28,720
Nothing.

15
00:05:29,060 --> 00:05:30,819
Nothing?

16
00:05:34,079 --> 00:05:34,939
That's pretty.

17
00:05:35,180 --> 00:05:36,019
Do mine for me too.

18
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,720
Since when do you wear this shade?

19
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,800
Isn't this the freebie

20
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:41,600
from our last shopping trip?

21
00:05:42,459 --> 00:05:43,699
What, trying to be 18 again?

22
00:05:46,319 --> 00:05:47,519
Aren't you having breakfast first?

23
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:49,120
These won't taste good cold.

24
00:05:49,199 --> 00:05:50,240
It's fine. I'm not hungry.

25
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,980
So that's why you're not hungry.

26
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:59,079
You've been sneaking egg tarts!

27
00:05:59,319 --> 00:06:00,800
These are hard to get.

28
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:02,240
The shop's by my brother's hospital.

29
00:06:02,399 --> 00:06:03,920
I keep asking him to get me some,

30
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:04,920
but he always refuses.

31
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:07,120
Says queuing wastes time.

32
00:06:08,759 --> 00:06:09,240
Really?

33
00:06:09,959 --> 00:06:12,399
A coworker grabbed some on the way.

34
00:06:13,839 --> 00:06:14,319
Done.

35
00:06:18,500 --> 00:06:19,060
So,

36
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,959
you came all this way

37
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,319
just to bring me breakfast?

38
00:06:25,839 --> 00:06:26,240
Yeah.

39
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:27,620
What else?

40
00:06:31,579 --> 00:06:32,699
You and Gu Yuan...

41
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,420
You met again last night?

42
00:06:35,639 --> 00:06:36,379
How do you know that?

43
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:39,120
You get chatty when you're excited.

44
00:06:39,279 --> 00:06:40,899
You avoid my eyes when you lie.

45
00:06:40,899 --> 00:06:42,300
You just did both.

46
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:48,600
Fine.

47
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:51,800
We did meet again last night.

48
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,720
I thought it was a one-time thing.

49
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:56,680
Then it happened again.

50
00:06:57,079 --> 00:06:58,259
I said I'd keep it casual.

51
00:06:58,879 --> 00:06:59,860
But now,

52
00:07:00,100 --> 00:07:01,560
when he doesn't text me,

53
00:07:01,980 --> 00:07:03,800
I actually feel a little disappointed.

54
00:07:04,079 --> 00:07:04,939
Isn't that good?

55
00:07:05,279 --> 00:07:06,639
It means you have feelings for him.

56
00:07:06,860 --> 00:07:08,899
It's time you had a real relationship.

57
00:07:11,319 --> 00:07:12,220
I don't know.

58
00:07:14,399 --> 00:07:17,639
I don't know what we are.

59
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,160
Just hooking up?

60
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:21,680
Catching feelings?

61
00:07:22,439 --> 00:07:23,680
Or nothing at all?

62
00:07:24,660 --> 00:07:25,319
You know,

63
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:27,000
he hasn't texted me today,

64
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,519
and I keep checking my phone.

65
00:07:28,519 --> 00:07:30,199
I feel so stupid.

66
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:33,379
What do you want it to be?

67
00:07:42,779 --> 00:07:43,959
I don't know.

68
00:07:44,980 --> 00:07:48,480
It's just so frustrating.

69
00:07:52,339 --> 00:07:52,860
Tell me,

70
00:07:53,300 --> 00:07:54,899
should I see someone else?

71
00:07:55,860 --> 00:07:57,879
Come on, give it a rest.

72
00:08:00,459 --> 00:08:01,040
I'll get it.

73
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:09,480
Oh, no.

74
00:08:47,620 --> 00:08:49,520
(Passenger Drop-off Area)
